Package: sysh
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: xezpeleta <xezpeleta@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: login shell for AI agents on servers
 sysh gives AI agents a safe, observable channel to operate a single
 server: the agent connects as the unprivileged `sy` user over SSH and
 its login shell enforces an operator-written argv policy. No shell
 semantics, no tokens, all enforcement and recording server-side.
Depends: systemd
Recommends: auditd
Suggests: openssh-server, sudo
